The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the source code of this repository only.
Two things it ships alongside the code carry their own terms.

Audio
-----
The seven clips in samples/ are taken from UrbanSound8K and remain under that
dataset's licence, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0, which is not
compatible with the MIT terms above. They are redistributed here only so that
the demo runs without a download.

  J. Salamon, C. Jacoby and J. P. Bello. A dataset and taxonomy for urban sound
  research. 22nd ACM International Conference on Multimedia, Orlando, 2014.
  https://urbansounddataset.weebly.com/urbansound8k.html

The full dataset is not included. pipeline.py and the scripts in experiments/
expect UrbanSound8K and ESC-50 to be downloaded separately.

Model weights
-------------
The frozen backbone is torchvision's ResNet-18 with its ImageNet weights, under
the licence of that project. checkpoints/mlp_prod.pth is the head trained here
and is covered by the MIT terms.
